                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e25a8ec-08e4-3af8-b740-0b6d446cc92b",
                        "entry_id": "8e3e3d83-4669-3f72-a664-b154b71d4280",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. совокупность симптомов, характеризующих определённое болезненное состояние организма"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5cefd3e-b583-4394-95c5-ca7d81f87cfc",
                                "sense_id": "1e25a8ec-08e4-3af8-b740-0b6d446cc92b",
                                "text": "Шифром хронической лучевой болезни, понятным тем, кому это необходимо, был ABC ― астеновегетативный синдром."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8a9ff76-955b-4df6-b8b7-fdea674aa55e",
                                "sense_id": "1e25a8ec-08e4-3af8-b740-0b6d446cc92b",
                                "text": "Причины нейрогенных болевых синдромов ― повреждение структур периферической или центральной нервной систем, участвующих в проведении болевых сигналов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1db76d16-19a1-4591-b52d-dc52f72e2d4b",
                                "sense_id": "1e25a8ec-08e4-3af8-b740-0b6d446cc92b",
                                "text": "— А у вас, Кирилл, думаю, пост-травматический синдром."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e9ef9c1-0d0b-31f0-9cc8-03366e3c1433",
                        "entry_id": "8e3e3d83-4669-3f72-a664-b154b71d4280",
                        "glosses": [
                            "публиц. комплекс разнородных отрицательных явлений, обусловленных одной и той же причиной"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d251a147-9736-4e0e-a0a9-d7d3dee65339",
                                "sense_id": "1e9ef9c1-0d0b-31f0-9cc8-03366e3c1433",
                                "text": "— Таак, умрут от голода… Какой-то синдром блокадников. Которые уже давно не в блокаде, а всё прячут хлеб под подушкой…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c46d69e3-6e63-4128-a4fc-6cb349404373",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e3e3d83-4669-3f72-a664-b154b71d4280",
                        "source_sense_description": "совокупность симптомов, характеризующих определённое болезненное состояние организма",
                        "target_lang_word": "syndrome",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "syndrome",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cc408a1-1fa0-3726-ab5b-ee795c4b165a",
                                        "entry_id": "6e44c21c-d73f-3e4f-b927-69aa6f428fd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A recognizable pattern of signs, symptoms and/or behaviours, especially of a disease or medical or psychological condition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e15bef8-6022-42c9-91ce-e9ca18ec43a3",
                                                "sense_id": "3cc408a1-1fa0-3726-ab5b-ee795c4b165a",
                                                "text": "Down syndrome; acquired immune deficiency syndrome; restless-leg syndrome; battered-wife syndrome"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d558655d-0aef-4811-8178-afb20cca2113",
                                                "sense_id": "3cc408a1-1fa0-3726-ab5b-ee795c4b165a",
                                                "text": "A “zone of rarity” emerges when symptoms cluster neatly into syndromes and interforms are uncommon, although not altogether absent. Fuzzy boundaries and interforms are a special problem for PTSD […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b07e93a7-13ce-4cfc-a654-e357b07378bf",
                                                "sense_id": "3cc408a1-1fa0-3726-ab5b-ee795c4b165a",
                                                "text": "Bats host many high-profile viruses that can infect humans, including severe acute respiratory syndrome and Ebola. A recent study explored the ecological variables that may contribute to bats’ propensity to harbor such zoonotic diseases by comparing them with another order of common reservoir hosts: rodents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6fbab4f-6e89-3595-babe-c703f2e2d0b7",
                                        "entry_id": "6e44c21c-d73f-3e4f-b927-69aa6f428fd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any set of characteristics regarded as identifying a certain type, condition, etc., usually adverse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1103c222-e87a-48a1-a2dc-cb95355e4652",
                                                "sense_id": "b6fbab4f-6e89-3595-babe-c703f2e2d0b7",
                                                "text": "not-in-my-backyard syndrome; tip-of-the-tongue syndrome"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34e4fc3e-4472-46de-a953-62be7e680fea",
                                                "sense_id": "b6fbab4f-6e89-3595-babe-c703f2e2d0b7",
                                                "text": "My roommate, Tony, and I were sitting in our living room on a Saturday afternoon trying to decide what to do that night. You know the syndrome: Saturday night when everyone is supposed to do something exciting and have a great time. If you don't, you're likely to wake up on Sunday morning feeling weird and lonely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37605d3b-06d3-4e3b-be08-a869a84d445a",
                                                "sense_id": "b6fbab4f-6e89-3595-babe-c703f2e2d0b7",
                                                "text": "Fledgling superstar Jimmy Carson couldn't bear another day in Edmonton living in the void created by the departure of Wayne Gretzky, whose brokenhearted fans never accepted his replacement. It was very difficult for me to play in Edmonton in the whole Gretzky syndrome,\" Carson said Thurs day after a six-player trade ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "510684a8-4e05-465d-9b9d-ee6103d8b616",
                                                "sense_id": "b6fbab4f-6e89-3595-babe-c703f2e2d0b7",
                                                "text": "Speaking of medicine, rationalizers seem to enjoy latching on health excuses. Syndromes are a fertile field. Let's say you're accused of being unable to accept responsibility or otherwise behaving like an adult. That's not your fault, you counter—you suffer from Peter Pan Syndrome. Can't get around to cleaning up your room or office cubicle? Of course not—you suffer from tertiary Bag Lady Syndrome."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43fbc543-8ad6-438c-9d65-5a0b0c8486c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e3e3d83-4669-3f72-a664-b154b71d4280",
                        "source_sense_description": "совокупность симптомов, характеризующих определённое болезненное состояние организма",
                        "target_lang_word": "Syndrom",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Syndrom",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e36df88d-b430-38d6-a733-41e686226428",
                                        "entry_id": "210c86fb-8d77-3bd9-a2a1-11ab73725a3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Gesamtheit aller Symptome einer Erkrankung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71742b4c-75c6-47b0-8596-adb5e4ac665e",
                                                "sense_id": "e36df88d-b430-38d6-a733-41e686226428",
                                                "text": "AIDS ist ein Syndrom, das heißt, es ist eine spezifische Kombination einer Reihe von Symptomen eines angegriffenen Immunsystems."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb3e99fa-253e-38ff-98d6-e863286a457a",
                                        "entry_id": "210c86fb-8d77-3bd9-a2a1-11ab73725a3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine Gruppe von Merkmalen oder Faktoren, deren gemeinsames Auftreten einen bestimmten Zusammenhang oder Zustand anzeigt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Soziologie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb7b077-d3b4-4129-bd8f-47da6759b980",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3e99fa-253e-38ff-98d6-e863286a457a",
                                                "text": "„Das Bambi-Syndrom bezeichnet eine Einstellung von Menschen zur Natur, bei der diese moralisiert und infantilisiert wird. Kennzeichnend für das Bambi-Syndrom ist eine Polarisierung dahingehend, dass die Natur generell gut und alles menschengemachte wie Technik, Zivilisation schlecht ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1578768-d3ca-435b-920c-385a84ca145a",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3e99fa-253e-38ff-98d6-e863286a457a",
                                                "text": "„Dieses typische Syndrom bei den Nachkriegsgenerationen in Europa, Nord- und Südamerika ist ein besonderer Ausdruck eines \"Hamlet-Problems\".“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
